{"id":"5c579348938edcfc","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Inverse System Models","display":"df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models — ZFC Model8 Inverse System Models","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models — ZFC Model8 Inverse System Models","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-inverse-system-models — ZFC Model8 Inverse System Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,I,\\leq_I,L,\\mathcal M,\\Pi,D_I,i,j,k,h,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal I,I,\\leq_I,L,\\mathcal M,\\Pi,D_I,i,j,k,h,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_{M_i}:M_i\\to M_i\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_{M_i}:M_i\\to M_i\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> are the constant, function, and relation-symbol components of the common language</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructureHom}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StructureHom}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (auxiliary structure-homomorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8InverseSystemModels}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8InverseSystemModels}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}structure\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{StructureHom}_S(h,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(h(c^{\\mathcal A})=c^{\\mathcal B})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;\\bigl(h(f^{\\mathcal A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathcal B}(h\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathcal A}\\to h\\circ\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathcal B})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}structure\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{StructureHom}_S(h,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(h(c^{\\mathcal A})=c^{\\mathcal B})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;\\bigl(h(f^{\\mathcal A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathcal B}(h\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathcal A}\\to h\\circ\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathcal B})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}system\\text{-}models} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8InverseSystemModels}_S(\\mathcal I,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L,\\mathcal M,\\Pi,D_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ik\\land j\\leq_Ik)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal M))\\land D_I=\\{\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in I\\times I\\mid i\\leq_Ij\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Pi,D_I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi))\\land\\mathcal I=\\langle L,\\mathcal M,\\Pi\\rangle\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M(i),L)\\land\\forall\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in D_I\\;\\mathrm{StructureHom}_S(\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle),\\mathcal M(j),\\mathcal M(i),L)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\Pi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M(i))})\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl((i\\leq_Ij\\land j\\leq_Ik)\\to\\Pi(\\langle k,i\\rangle)=\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)\\circ\\Pi(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}system\\text{-}models} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8InverseSystemModels}_S(\\mathcal I,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L,\\mathcal M,\\Pi,D_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ik\\land j\\leq_Ik)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal M))\\land D_I=\\{\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in I\\times I\\mid i\\leq_Ij\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Pi,D_I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi))\\land\\mathcal I=\\langle L,\\mathcal M,\\Pi\\rangle\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M(i),L)\\land\\forall\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in D_I\\;\\mathrm{StructureHom}_S(\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle),\\mathcal M(j),\\mathcal M(i),L)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\Pi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M(i))})\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl((i\\leq_Ij\\land j\\leq_Ik)\\to\\Pi(\\langle k,i\\rangle)=\\Pi(\\langle j,i\\rangle)\\circ\\Pi(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The objects are now structures in one common language and the bonding maps are typed structure homomorphisms, not arbitrary functions between untyped sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b87